  "description": "Starparty — the bike that refuses to be put in a category.\nBuilt for those legendary days when the pavement suddenly turns to dirt and the adventure really begins, Starparty rolls happily into the unknown. Paired with a 60mm suspension fork and 700x50c tires, it’ll keep you feeling fresh long after your buddies bonk.\n\nDrop bar? Flat bar? Riser bar? Yes. Starparty doesn’t judge — it just wants to party.\n\nWhether you’re blasting fire roads, sneaking through backwoods shortcuts, or shredding suburban singletrack, this rig is down for whatever.\n\nStarparty isn’t just a bike — it’s your blank canvas. Go ahead. Build your dream machine. Then ride it like you stole it!\n\nLet's talk about bikes! Schedule uninterrupted time to chat about Starparty. Book time now!\n\nStandard Features:\n\nGrade 9 Seamless Butted 3Al/2.5V Titanium\n\nSuspension Corrected Geometry\n\nMRP Baxter II 60mm Travell\n\nT47 Threaded Bottom Bracket\n\nFull Assortment of Rack, Bottle, and Fender Mounts\n\nUDH Derailleur Hanger (run traditional derailleur or SRAM Full Mount)\n\n700x50c Tire Clearance\n\nDi2, AXS, Mechanical Shifting Compatibility\n\nTraditional Internal Cable Routing\n\nFull Internal Cable Routing Compatible with Ported and Polished Head Tube Port\n\n*Frameset includes: MRP Baxter II 60mm fork, Headset, Seat Clamp, Front & Rear axles\n\nLet's talk about bikes! Schedule uninterrupted time to chat about Starparty. Book time now!",
